@ The Champion is Dad again: HISHAM (replaces Wallace). Gym 8's leader HANY (replaces Juan) runs the
@ Sootopolis GYM for him. Written with the new names: CEASER, HALEEB and SNICKERS are the cats.

@@ file: data/maps/CaveOfOrigin_B1F/scripts.inc
CaveOfOrigin_B1F_Text_WallaceStory:
	.string "HISHAM: …LAYTH?\p"
	.string "It's me. Your actual father.\n"
	.string "Just got back from LIBYA.\p"
	.string "SEQUOIA trip. Big deal.\n"
	.string "Very big deal.\p"
	.string "I hear NABIL's been doing my job\n"
	.string "in PETALBURG. Good for him.\p"
	.string "I'm also the CHAMPION, by the way.\n"
	.string "We'll talk at the LEAGUE.\p"
	.string "HANY runs the GYM here.\n"
	.string "He's my old pool partner.\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "CEASER and HALEEB, the two POKéMON\n"
	.string "fighting out there, are legends.\p"
	.string "But there's a third legend.\p"
	.string "Somewhere, there is a POKéMON\n"
	.string "named SNICKERS.\p"
	.string "They say SNICKERS ended their fight\n"
	.string "once before, with one swipe.\p"
	.string "But even I have no idea where\n"
	.string "SNICKERS is…$"

@@ file: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc
SootopolisCity_Text_DazzledByMentor:
	.string "HISHAM: HANY's GYM is tough.\p"
	.string "He beats me at pool, too.\n"
	.string "Sometimes. Rarely.$"

@@ file: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc
EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_IntroSpeech:
	.string "HISHAM: Welcome, LAYTH.\p"
	.string "So, LAYTH. I see you're all\n"
	.string "grown up.\p"
	.string "Sorry I didn't have time to play\n"
	.string "catch. I was busy playing pool\l"
	.string "with MO. And in LIBYA.\p"
	.string "Your mother sent you, didn't she?\n"
	.string "Is this about the side of the road?\p"
	.string "I came back for her! Eventually!\p"
	.string "You beat the MOVERSE. You beat the\n"
	.string "ELITE MALIKS. You even beat NABIL.\p"
	.string "Now!\p"
	.string "This is the last game of the night\n"
	.string "at the pool table.\p"
	.string "Show me everything you've got!$"

EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_Defeat:
	.string "I, the CHAMPION, fall in defeat…\p"
	.string "To my own kid! The one I never\n"
	.string "played catch with!\p"
	.string "I'm telling everyone at SEQUOIA.\n"
	.string "And HAMZA. Mostly HAMZA.\p"
	.string "Well played, LAYTH!$"

EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech:
	.string "HISHAM: {PLAYER}…\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON called every shot\n"
	.string "and sank every one.\p"
	.string "You now stand at the top of\n"
	.string "the POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
	.string "I now proclaim you to be the new\n"
	.string "HOENN region…$"

EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_BirchArriveRatePokedex:
	.string "PROF. MO: See?\n"
	.string "What did I tell you, HAMZA?\p"
	.string "Didn't I tell you that you don't need\n"
	.string "to worry about {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "… … … … … … … …\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}, you've finally done it.\p"
	.string "NABIL, the MOVERSE, the MALIKS,\n"
	.string "and your actual dad!\p"
	.string "HISHAM owes me crazy fries now.\p"
	.string "Ah, yes!\p"
	.string "What became of your POKéDEX?\n"
	.string "Here, let me see.$"
